# Canonicalises author identities for git shortlog / log --use-mailmap.
#
# Two problems this fixes:
#   1. Daniel's commit 0600116 was authored with a typo'd domain
#      (post.bgu.ca.il instead of post.bgu.ac.il), splitting her into two
#      contributors.
#   2. Commits made on SLURM nodes take an auto-generated <user@node> address,
#      so one person appears as a dozen contributors, one per compute node.
#
# NOTE: GitHub's Contributors graph does NOT read .mailmap. It matches commits
# to accounts by author email, and it only counts the DEFAULT branch. This file
# fixes local git tooling; see README/git notes for the branch-merge fix.

Daniel Schmidt <schmidtd@post.bgu.ac.il> <schmidtd@post.bgu.ca.il>

